114985", "uri": "https://scontent-iad3-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/491822779_811233931448318_6656375589413651573_n.png?_nc_cat=108&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=jjFwAcR-slEQ7kNvwFvxogF&_nc_oc=AdoJFAozseTCI0fh21hvX-VftEL2DE7nnP32VGsQkZ3YnPFNHohrC0LRnWqWk5c3ug4&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-iad3-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQT_WqpvMzMaDS-rh41vzKAJXl7x8wSPujQKS7Xa14a6qA&oe=6AF20933"}, "display_name": "Wiped Clean Demo", "keywords": ["wipedclean", "horror", "cleaninggame", "cleaningsimulator", "simulator"], "long_description": "You\u2019re not just a cleaner. You\u2019re an undercover agent, infiltrating the world of **crime and insanity** by posing as a cleaner, secretly collecting evidence against a mysterious hitman. The hitman runs a large organization called the Syndicate.\n\n{2013386939489875}\n\nThe deeper you dig, the closer you get to uncovering how he operates\u2014and how he does his assassinations.\n\n{1196365369217633}\n\nThe game has a scary layer. As you explore a crime scene, unsettling things could happen\u2014shadows, whispers & apparitions.\n\n{1590290165715389}\n\nHere\u2019s the part that gets sticky: You\u2019re deep undercover.\n\n**Your mission**: Infiltrate the Syndicate, and capture the Hitman. The Syndicate doesn\u2019t tolerate failure. And they definitely don\u2019t tolerate rats.\n\n{634067086310658}\n\nEach dead body has a background story of their own and you can explore more around to gather evidence and know more about the dead. The more you explore, the more rewarding it is. \n\n{1775864393046193}\n\n**Wiped Clean is OUT NOW**: https://www.meta.com/experiences/wiped-clean/7821594727952674/\n\n**Talk to the Devs and join our community on Discord**:  https://discord.gg/cK4aG9sp8f\n", "short_description": "You play as an undercover agent who is cleaning crime scenes and secretly collecting evidence to capture the ruthless hitman. "}]}, "developer_name": null, "developer_privacy_policy_url": "https://www.luminarycreations.net/privacy-